<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %></title><%- include('partials/styles') %></head>
<body class="admin-body"><%- include('partials/sidebar', { activePage: 'visitors' }) %><main class="admin-main admin-main--wide"><div class="dashboard-container">
<div class="dashboard-welcome visitors-heading"><div><h1>高级访客分析</h1><p class="dashboard-subtitle">周期对比、来源归因、回访留存、访问路径与内容参与度</p></div><form method="GET" action="/admin/visitors/advanced" data-admin-pjax-form><select class="admin-toolbar-select" name="days" onchange="this.form.requestSubmit()"><option value="7" <%= analytics.days===7?'selected':'' %>>最近 7 天</option><option value="30" <%= analytics.days===30?'selected':'' %>>最近 30 天</option><option value="90" <%= analytics.days===90?'selected':'' %>>最近 90 天</option></select></form></div>
<nav class="visitors-page-tabs"><a href="/admin/visitors">数据概览</a><a href="/admin/visitors#visitors-table">访客记录</a><a class="active" aria-current="page" href="/admin/visitors/advanced">高级分析</a></nav>
<section class="advanced-metrics"><% [['PV','pv',analytics.current.pv],['UV','uv',analytics.current.uv],['会话','sessions',analytics.current.sessions],['平均停留','avgStay',analytics.current.avg_stay+'s']].forEach(metric => { const change=analytics.comparison[metric[1]]; %><article><small><%= metric[0] %></small><strong><%= metric[2] %></strong><span class="<%= change>=0?'is-positive':'is-negative' %>"><%= change>=0?'+':'' %><%= change %>% 较上期</span></article><% }) %><article><small>跳出率</small><strong><%= analytics.current.bounceRate %>%</strong><span>单页会话占比</span></article></section>
<div class="advanced-grid">
<section class="analytics-card"><header class="analytics-card-header"><div><h2>内容访问漏斗</h2><p>从首页进入、内容访问到深度阅读的转化</p></div></header><div class="analytics-card-content advanced-funnel"><% analytics.funnel.forEach((step,index)=>{ %><div><header><span><%= index+1 %></span><strong><%= step.label %></strong><b><%= step.visitors %> 人</b></header><div><i style="width:<%= Math.min(100,step.rate) %>%"></i></div><small><%= step.rate %>% 相对首页访客</small></div><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="analytics-card"><header class="analytics-card-header"><div><h2>来源归因</h2><p>UTM 优先，其次识别搜索、引荐和直接访问</p></div></header><div class="analytics-card-content"><table class="admin-table compact-table"><thead><tr><th>来源</th><th>PV</th><th>UV</th></tr></thead><tbody><% analytics.sources.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.source %></td><td><%= row.pv %></td><td><%= row.uv %></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!analytics.sources.length){ %><tr><td colspan="3">暂无数据</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="analytics-card"><header class="analytics-card-header"><div><h2>7 日回访留存</h2><p>按首次访问周统计一周内再次访问比例</p></div></header><div class="analytics-card-content"><table class="admin-table compact-table"><thead><tr><th>首访周</th><th>新访客</th><th>回访</th><th>留存率</th></tr></thead><tbody><% analytics.retention.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.cohort %></td><td><%= row.visitors %></td><td><%= row.returned %></td><td><strong><%= row.rate %>%</strong></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!analytics.retention.length){ %><tr><td colspan="4">暂无数据</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="analytics-card"><header class="analytics-card-header"><div><h2>高频路径转移</h2><p>同一会话中页面之间的真实跳转</p></div></header><div class="analytics-card-content path-flow-list"><% analytics.transitions.forEach(row=>{ %><div><span><%= row.from_path %></span><i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i><span><%= row.to_path %></span><strong><%= row.count %></strong></div><% }) %><% if(!analytics.transitions.length){ %><p class="empty-state">暂无多页会话</p><% } %></div></section>
<section class="analytics-card"><header class="analytics-card-header"><div><h2>文章深度阅读</h2><p>停留至少 30 秒或滚动达到 75% 记为参与</p></div></header><div class="analytics-card-content"><table class="admin-table compact-table"><thead><tr><th>文章</th><th>阅读</th><th>参与率</th></tr></thead><tbody><% analytics.content.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.path %></td><td><%= row.views %></td><td><strong><%= row.engagementRate %>%</strong></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!analytics.content.length){ %><tr><td colspan="3">暂无文章访问</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></section>
</div>
<section class="analytics-card advanced-campaigns"><header class="analytics-card-header"><div><h2>UTM 活动</h2><p>按 Campaign、Source 与 Medium 汇总</p></div></header><div class="analytics-card-content"><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr><th>Campaign</th><th>Source</th><th>Medium</th><th>PV</th><th>UV</th></tr></thead><tbody><% analytics.campaigns.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.campaign %></td><td><%= row.source||'—' %></td><td><%= row.medium||'—' %></td><td><%= row.pv %></td><td><%= row.uv %></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!analytics.campaigns.length){ %><tr><td colspan="5">暂无 UTM 活动数据</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></section>
</div></main><script src="<%= asset('/js/toast.js') %>"></script><script src="<%= asset('/js/admin.js') %>"></script></body></html>
